# Screenshots dropped in the REPO ROOT by testers and design passes (01-landing-1440.png and
# friends). Transient evidence, not source — and this is the substrate every product consumes, so
# anything committed here is carried by every consumer forever.
#
# Scoped to the root ON PURPOSE. A blanket `*.png` would also silently ignore two things that must
# stay addable: the scaffold's own asset (`templates/*/public/og-image.png` — a missing OG image
# fails PRODUCT_STANDARDS §7 on every product generated from that template) and committed
# naive-tester evidence under `naive-tester-reports/<date>/`. Screenshots that are EVIDENCE belong
# in a report directory; screenshots in the root are leftovers.
/*.png
